{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/992802-basic-stats-for-a-ufo","id":992802,"title":"Basic stats for a \"UFO\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-24T23:19:19-07:00","id":992802,"title":"Basic stats for a \"UFO\"","content":"How would I go about using the 2e vehicle mechanics to create basic stats for some sort of UFO? A basic profile that could be used to represent any sort of anomalous vehicle, be it constructed by a mad scientist, made of suborned infrastructure, or so on. <br /> <br /> The basic traits I'm looking for are:<br /> <br /> - Flight ability (or, alternately, submarine capability)<br /> - Some sort of &quot;cloaking device&quot; that explains why this thing doesn't get picked up instantly. It's faulty by default, though, so people periodically get glimpses of them. <br /> - Transdimensional capability. The ability to spend some sort of fuel to travel to one of the parallel worlds. The Astral, the Hedge, the Shadow, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T23:36:42-07:00","id":992809,"title":"","content":"I think there's one in Astral Realms, or possibly Summoners?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T23:38:18-07:00","id":992810,"title":"","content":"Hm, yeah, Astral Realms does have UFOs. Though I'm looking more for the sort of thing a mad scientist could make in her garage, including a statblock that makes it possible to determine what happens when the MIBs fire a rocket launcher at it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T23:44:46-07:00","id":992816,"title":"","content":"Vehicle UFO<br /> Speed: 240<br /> Dice Modifier: +4 Stealth, +2 Drive<br /> Durability/Size: 5/40<br /> Structure: 45<br /> <br /> Abilities<br /> High Acceleration: As Chronicles of Darkness.<br /> Flight: As Chronicles of Darkness.<br /> Cloaking Device: Source of the +4 Dice modifier above. Shorts out for a scene on a critical failure on the Drive tests. Also shorts out on turns in which High Acceleration is used.<br /> Transdimensional capability: If it lands and charges the Transdimensional Drive for 8.76e+7hrs it is capable of translocating to twilight, the spirit world or a lower depth for 24hrs.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T23:50:29-07:00","id":992820,"title":"","content":"Thank you! That's very cool. I'd probably say that most UFOs can only access one other realm (alright, Gary, I don't know much about the spirit world and it's not gonna come up in this game so your UFO can either go to the Hedge or the Astral).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T23:58:21-07:00","id":992825,"title":"","content":"If you want it possible to be shot down, I'd also lower the size to something more like 15 giving it a structure or 20. Structure is the health of a building/vehicle and with 5 Durability, a size 40 UFO would be almost impossible to shoot down with things like rocket launchers. (Size forty is about the size of a mansion).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T00:01:10-07:00","id":992829,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I don't really see something like that being garage mad scientist level. Not saying it doesn't have a place- it could be something constructed by a large conspiracy, that could easily serve as an important element of a story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}